  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the chickpeas, onion, caraway seeds, thyme, garlic powder, salt, and pepper.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and bake for 20-25 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
